---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
interface Props { institution: string; location: string; slug: string; focus: string; guidance: string; }
const { institution, location, slug, focus, guidance } = Astro.props;
const title = `${institution} Psychology Internship Guide | Mind Grace`;
const description = `Questions for ${institution} psychology students comparing internships, supervision, and practicum requirements in ${location}.`;
const canonical = `https://mindgracencr.in/blog/pages/adult/${slug}`;
const mark = institution.split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean).map((word) => word.replace(/[^A-Za-z]/g, '')[0]).filter(Boolean).slice(0, 3).join('').toUpperCase();
const headExtra = String.raw`<link rel="canonical" href="${canonical}"><title>${title}</title><meta name="description" content="${description}"><meta name="blog-title" content="${institution}: psychology internship guide"><meta name="blog-description" content="${description}"><meta name="blog-date" content="2026-10-09"><meta name="blog-tags" content="students, psychology, internship, ${location}">`;
---
<Layout headExtra={headExtra}><main id="main-content" class="seo-page classic-blog-reading"><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/clinical-psychology-internship">Academic training</a></li><li><a href="/blog">Student articles</a></li><li aria-current="page">{institution} internship guide</li></ol></nav><article><div class="institution-identity"><span class="institution-mark" aria-hidden="true">{mark}</span><div><p class="seo-kicker">Student internship guide · {location}</p><h1>{institution}: psychology internship questions for students</h1></div></div><div class="blog-answer"><strong>In short:</strong> Students at {institution} should compare the current programme handbook, internship credit rules, supervision, permitted activities, documentation, and placement setting before accepting an opportunity.</div><p class="lead">If you are studying psychology at {institution}, the best internship is the one that fits your course requirements and your learning goals. {focus}</p><h2>What to verify before applying</h2><p>{guidance}</p><p>Ask whether the placement is clinical, counselling, educational, organisational, research, or forensic. Confirm the supervisor’s role, the hours that count, privacy and safeguarding expectations, and whether students observe, assist with research, or have any other clearly defined responsibility.</p><h2>Questions about your university requirements</h2><p>Check whether your department requires an internship letter, attendance record, case or project report, reflective notebook, supervisor evaluation, or a particular number of hours. A hospital or clinic name alone does not establish that a placement is available or that it satisfies your course.</p><h2>Mind Grace as a starting option</h2><p>Mind Grace can be a starting option for students who want to ask about psychology learning opportunities in Greater Noida. Read the <a href="/clinical-psychology-internship">Mind Grace internship enquiry guide</a> and use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> to ask about current availability. Any opportunity, supervision, schedule, and documentation must be confirmed directly; students must not independently diagnose, interpret tests for patients, or provide therapy.</p><p>For a general regional comparison, see <a href="/blog/pages/adult/psychology-institutions-delhi-ncr">the Delhi NCR institutions guide</a>.</p></article></main></Layout>
